      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Build frequency map\n   Map: {3: 2, 2: 1}  or  {2: 4, 1: 3}\n\n2. Iterate map to find max count\n   Compare each value, track highest\n\n3. Return key with highest count",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
